body: "Acceptance: explicitly select a prior standup commitment or Plan revision; keep completed, changed-scope, unsupported and still-pending commitments distinct; missing captures never imply failure; a bounded report covers twenty commitments without full source bodies. Provide typed SDK and CLI, compact JSON/TOON, actionable refusals, README/example, SDK model-based validation and public tracker measurements."
